  "title": "Small Rides, Big Impact: How Our Berlin Team Turned a Bike Commute into a Sustainability Success Story",
  "summary": "We know that meaningful progress often starts with simple actions. Earlier this summer, employees at our site in Berlin, Germany, participated in the Bike-to-Work Challenge 2026, a two-week initiative organized by our Environmental Sustainability affinity group and Sustainability team. The goal was straightforward: encourage employees to choose cycling over driving whenever possible and experience the benefits of a healthier, more sustainable commute",
